Here the branch condition changed from `body` (trimmed body truthiness) to `_adoThreadRawBody(rootComment)` (RAW body truthiness). The PR says: "whitespace-only ADO comment rendering its author line" is a quirk pinned, not fixed. For a whitespace-only body: raw = '  ' (truthy), trimmed = '' (falsy). Original: else-branch → `_[No comment body]_\n`. New: if-branch → `**author** (date):\n` (body = trimmed = empty string). That IS a behavior change for whitespace-only comments!

