So the change: body separator `\n` → `\n`. That's the ONE difference. The PR description's "GitLab single-`\n` body lines" claim says single-\n is a quirk of the CURRENT code being pinned... but actually the current (main) code has `\n` after body. Hmm wait, let me recheck. New test:

